<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">chat</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">chat</ansi> command talks on the world-wide <ansi fg="cyan">chat</ansi>
channel — everyone online who has the channel on will hear you. This is the
general out-of-character channel. You can also use
<ansi fg="command">`</ansi> as a shortcut.

Turn any channel on or off with <ansi fg="command">channels</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

::keep
  <ansi fg="command">chat anyone around?</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">` anyone around?</ansi>
::

  Output to everyone with chat on:

  <ansi fg="cyan">(chat)</ansi> Charles: anyone around?
